   "say": "His journey also put Mali on the map. Literally. In 1375, a map known as the Catalan Atlas, made on the Spanish island of Majorca, showed a king seated on a throne in West Africa, holding a golden nugget. The text next to him called him the richest and noblest king in all the land. Europe now knew where the gold came from.",
